OL,3,CDickie Bird left #4m in will
OL,5,FDickie Bird left nearly #4 million in
OL,6,Fhis will when he died last year,
OL,7,Fdocuments reveal.
OL,9,FThe cricket legend, who died in
OL,10,FSeptember at the age of 92, passed an
OL,11,Festate worth #3.94m to a discretionary
OL,12,Ftrust.
OL,14,FThe value of his estate will shared
OL,15,Fout between family, including his
OL,16,Fsister Marjorie Wyatt, niece Rachel
OL,17,FWyatt and her children, and friend
OL,18,FGraham Varger, as well as charity.
