OL,3,CDickie Bird left #4m in will
OL,5,FBorn Harold Dennis Bird, Bird enjoyed
OL,6,Fa modest playing career for Yorkshire
OL,7,Fand Leicestershire before going on to
OL,8,Fbecome one of the best-loved officials
OL,9,Fin the game.
OL,11,FHe umpired 66 international test
OL,12,Fmatches and 69 one-day games before
OL,13,Fretiring in 1998.
OL,15,FYorkshire Cricket, where he was named
OL,16,Fpresident in 2014, described him as
OL,17,F"the most famous and popular official
OL,18,Fin the game's history".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/3
