OL,3,CDickie Bird left #4m in will
OL,5,FDespite his apparent fortune, Bird
OL,6,Fcontinued to live modestly at his home
OL,7,Fin Paddock Road, in Staincross,
OL,8,FBarnsley.
OL,10,FAs per his wishes as stated in probate
OL,11,Fdocuments, Bird was cremated following
OL,12,Fa service at St Mary's Church in his
OL,13,Fhome town of Barnsley.
